            "This is an illustrative, hypothetical example. A housing association is replacing its repairs management system. The same project appears in our [project baseline](/project-management/project-baseline/) guide, where change request CR-07 (a mobile app for repair operatives) is approved and the cost and schedule baselines are revised. Here we follow the same change through configuration management.",
